{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<div class=\"text_box\">\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國地震台網指，四川宜賓市高縣附近，在凌晨零時12分發生5.5級地震，暫時未有傷亡報告。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-28T17:00:00.126516+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":44,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}